al":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn gdextension class deconstructor, calling base class method causes UB: \n\n```cpp\nExampleClass::~ExampleClass() {\n\tprint_line(\"deconstruct\");\n\tprint_line(get_reference_count());\n}\n```\n\n```\ndeconstruct\ncore/object/ref_counted.cpp:55:9: runtime error: member access within address 0x614000258850 which does not point to an object of type 'const RefCounted'\n0x614000258850: note: object is of type 'Object'\n be be be be  30 f5 85 cc f3 55 00 00  68 b6 19 00 40 61 00 00  60 56 ba 00 40 60 00 00  be be be be\n              ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n              vptr for 'Object'\nSUMMARY: UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer: undefined-behavior core/object/ref_counted.cpp:55:9 in \n0\n```\n\nThis is because the godot native instance is already being deconstructing when freeing gdextension instance, so it's UB for extension class to access any base class method except `Object` in deconstructor:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8ebf8ae23c095d4185e79602bb18a6952e192b56/core/object/object.cpp#L2258-L2269\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBuild Godot with undefined behavior sanitizer, run a game with gdextension that calls base class methods (except `Object` methods) in deconstructor.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user